{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: SourceHanSansCNRegular;\">大埔宏福苑火災獨立委員會舉行最後一場聽證會，委員會代表大律師總結陳詞，指政府的監管機制與市民的期望落差大，亦應負上一定責任。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">➤</span><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1183370-%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E6%9D%9C%E6%B7%A6%E5%A0%83%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E7%9B%A3%E7%AE%A1%E6%A9%9F%E5%88%B6%E8%88%87%E5%B8%82%E6%B0%91%E6%9C%9F%E6%9C%9B%E8%90%BD%E5%B7%AE%E5%A4%A7%E6%87%89%E8%B2%A0%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%9A%E8%B2%AC%E4%BB%BB\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">宏福苑｜杜淦堃：政府監管機制與市民期望落差大　應負一定責任</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br/><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: SourceHanSansCNRegular;\">政府修訂對宏福苑業主租金補助安排，劃一發放四期合共30萬元。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">➤</span><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1183407-%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E4%BF%AE%E8%A8%82%E7%A7%9F%E9%87%91%E8%A3%9C%E5%8A%A9%E5%AE%89%E6%8E%92%E5%8A%83%E4%B8%80%E7%99%BC%E6%94%BE%E5%9B%9B%E6%9C%9F%E5%90%88%E5%85%B130%E8%90%AC%E5%85%83\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">宏福苑｜政府修訂租金補助安排　劃一發放四期合共30萬元</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br/><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: SourceHanSansCNRegular;\">地盤全面禁煙法例今日刊憲，即時生效。任何人在地盤內違例吸煙，可被定額罰款3,000元，違規承建商可罰款40萬元。勞工處早上派員巡查地盤，發出了一張定額罰款通知書。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.38; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">➤</span><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1183372-%E5%9C%B0%E7%9B%A4%E5%85%A8%E9%9D%A2%E7%A6%81%E7%85%99%E6%B3%95%E4%BE%8B%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E5%8B%9E%E5%B7%A5%E8%99%95%E6%B4%BE%E5%93%A1%E5%B7%A1%E6%9F%A5%E7%99%BC%E4%B8%80%E5%BC%B5%E5%AE%9A%E9%A1%8D%E7%BD%B0%E6%AC%BE%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E6%9B%B8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">地盤全面禁煙法例生效　勞工處派員巡查發一張定額罰款通知書</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br/><br/><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: SourceHanSansCNRegular;\">立法會三讀通過《皇崗口岸港方口岸區條例草案》，政府指會適時公布開通日期。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">➤</span><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1183419-%E7%9A%87%E5%B4%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%B2%B8%E6%B8%AF%E6%96%B9%E5%8F%A3%E5%B2%B8%E5%8D%80%E6%A2%9D%E4%BE%8B%E8%8D%89%E6%A1%88%E4%B8%89%E8%AE%80%E9%80%9A%E9%81%8E%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E6%8C%87%E6%9C%83%E9%81%A9%E6%99%82%E5%85%AC%E5%B8%83%E9%96%8B%E9%80%9A%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%9F\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">《皇崗口岸港方口岸區條例草案》三讀通過　政府指會適時公布開通日期</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">(旁述由AI生成)</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-17T11:58:35.632221+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":350,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}